// title: KQL for detecting potential hashtag#RegreSSHion abuse
// date: 2026-10-23
// product: Sentinel
// tables: CommonSecurityLog
// purpose: KQL for detecting potential hashtag#RegreSSHion abuse
// source: https://github.com/SlimKQL/Hunting-Queries-Detection-Rules/blob/9c838dc165ac602c525321c6f475e5c90f2fd7d2/Sentinel/KQL%20for%20detecting%20potential%20hashtag#RegreSSHion%20abuse.kql
